{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/836916-so-i-ve-had-a-god-machine-dream","id":836916,"title":"So I've had a God Machine Dream...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-25T01:16:56-08:00","id":836916,"title":"So I've had a God Machine Dream...","content":"I don't know how I know it was about the God Machine- technically, it was never mentioned or seen- but you know how dreams works :P<br /> <br /> Anyway, it was about a small hospital in a lone city, in which all the people in the community had a tendency to meet up in the hospital- while me and some other people were strangers in the city who just came to the city. It has all began with the fact the secretary tried to tell us something about weird things in the city- and then she vanished, leaving a digital &quot;will be back soon&quot; message. There was also a conspiracy theorist who talked how the television company was hunting her using the police for revealing some hidden activity where everyone actually pay less than they should or something like that, and in order to keep the cheap prices they tried to kill her. Eventually, the secretary was found together with the rest of the people, but she lost her job and got some sort of &quot;vaccine&quot; like many other people, and it looked like all the doctors were recording who get which vaccine or something...<br /> <br /> Anyway- do you have a good idea how to turn it into a chronicle? Or did you had weird dreams about the Machine? :P<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76939-so-i-had-a-dream\">EDIT- and apparently, it wasn't my first one :P</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 02-25-2016, 08:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T01:43:26-08:00","id":836922,"title":"","content":"You did not dream about the God Machine, child. You are simply confused. It is rather silly, isn't it? You will cease talking about this silliness.<br /> <br /> You did not dream about the God Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T05:00:09-08:00","id":836971,"title":"","content":"Come my Unchained brothers and sisters, kill the Stigmatic prophet- after we jack his brain!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T05:26:34-08:00","id":836983,"title":"","content":"This funny, tonight I had a dream about being a Demon and working my way out to escape the God-Machine/Angels!<br /> <br /> But things worked a little different than the game, for in my dream I did not need a pact or anything. I remember I was at a supermarket and saw a woman walking around with a baby on her cart (which the baby may or may not have been a large watermelon), and I remember thinking I needed to hide from the machine, so I came next to her looked on her eyes and said: &quot;I'm your husband, this is our child. You will believe that, and listen/obey to what I say&quot;. <br /> And then it was like I was really her husband, and we walked out of the place hand in hand with our watermelon child. <br /> I also remember thinking about the real husband when I did that, and It was like he disappeared (perhaps I burned him like i would if we had a soul pact, but I know i didn't make one lol).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5690-mithrael","name":"Mithrael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}